### Register organizer
POST {{base_url}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "anna@example.com", "password": "secret123", "role": "organizer"}

### Login organizer
# @name loginOrg
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "anna@example.com", "password": "secret123"}

### Create event (organizer)
POST {{base_url}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{orgToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Rock Concert", "starts_at": "2026-12-31T20:00:00Z", "category_qty": {"VIP": 10, "Regular": 100}}

### List events
GET {{base_url}}/events